16. Astoria
17. Jackson Heights
18. Flushing
19. Sunnyside
20. Ditmars

Let $v_i$ be the Value (development benefit) for area $i$ and $w_i$ be the Weight (resource requirement) for area $i$, as given below:

| Area (ProductName)      | $v_i$ (Value) | $w_i$ (Weight) |
|------------------------|:-------------:|:--------------:|
| Queens                 | 469           | 954            |
| Brooklyn               | 290           | 650            |
| Manhattan              | 236           | 961            |
| Bronx                  | 235           | 950            |
